{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W1kZDSwu7cCcZBAWjutFPf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# T-002 验收标准\n2\t\n3\t对应 AC-005（levels: unit）。所有命令在仓库根（`C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\002`）用 `pwsh -NoProfile` 执行，Node ≥ 20。基准提交：`f75bb76`（0.1 副本的来源）。brief 没有给出既有验收报告路径。\n4\t\n5\t格式约定（与 `ci-runner.ps1` 的解析规则一致）：每个用例是一个 `### <编号> <标题>` 小节，编号形如 `A1`、`B3`、`D4`（字母 + 数字），小节下只有一个 ```powershell 代码块且其首行就是可执行命令；断言写成紧随其后的项目符号。每个脚本在全部断言成立时打印 `<编号> OK` 并以退出码 0 结束，否则以非 0 退出。脚本自包含，不依赖任何前置小节定义的函数或变量。\n6\t\n7\t## 1. 总入口\n8\t\n9\t### A1 过滤运行 AC-005\n10\t\n11\t```powershell\n12\t$out = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-005 2>&1 | Out-String)\n13\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n14\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"run-tests --ac AC-005 exited $code\" }\n15\tif ($out -notmatch 'run-tests: filtered ') { throw 'stdout is missing run-tests: filtered' }\n16\tif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n17\t$cross = [string][char]0x2716\n18\tif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'stdout contains the failure mark' }\n19\t$titles = @(\n20\t  '[AC-005] stable: deprecated models are never candidates',\n21\t  '[AC-005] stable: unverified identity is rejected unless require_verified is false',\n22\t  '[AC-005] stable: level filter rejects other levels',\n23\t  '[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded',\n24\t  '[AC-005] stable: the four schema names',\n25\t  '[AC-005] stable: imports only the v0.1 copy',\n26\t  '[AC-005] frozen: untouched fixture root passes',\n27\t  '[AC-005] frozen: changing one registered byte fails with frozen.hash_mismatch',\n28\t  '[AC-005] frozen: CRLF checkout of a registered file still passes',\n29\t  '[AC-005] frozen: lib/, bin/ and config/ paths are rejected as frozen.forbidden_path',\n30\t  '[AC-005] frozen: scripts/ and other unlisted paths fail with frozen.outside_allowed',\n31\t  '[AC-005] frozen: contracts/spec and contracts/golden paths are allowed',\n32\t  '[AC-005] frozen: unregistered file in the v0.1 copy fails with frozen.unregistered',\n33\t  '[AC-005] frozen: missing registered file fails with frozen.file_missing',\n34\t  '[AC-005] frozen: path traversal and absolute paths are rejected',\n35\t  '[AC-005] defects: well-formed fixture ledger passes',\n36\t  '[AC-005] defects: repro edited after registration fails with defects.repro_changed',\n37\t  '[AC-005] defects: canary that still passes fails with defects.canary_survived',\n38\t  '[AC-005] defects: missing canary fails with defects.canary_missing',\n39\t  '[AC-005] defects: repro failing on the unmodified copy fails with defects.repro_baseline_failed',\n40\t  '[AC-005] defects: a repro that cannot even load is not counted as a canary hit'\n41\t)\n42\tforeach ($title in $titles) { if (-not $out.Contains($title)) { throw \"missing title: $title\" } }\n43\t$repros = [regex]::Matches($out, '\\[repro\\] \\[AC-005\\]').Count\n44\tif ($repros -lt 10) { throw \"expected 10 repro titles, found $repros\" }\n45\t'A1 OK'\n46\texit 0\n47\t```\n48\t\n49\t- 退出码 0。\n50\t- stdout 含 `run-tests: filtered `，不含 `FAIL`、不含 `✖`。\n51\t- 上面 21 个标题子串全部出现（各对应一个 `✔`）。\n52\t- stdout 含 10 个以 `[repro] [AC-005]` 开头的标题（a3-runner 的 `[repro]` 不带 `[AC-005]` 标签，由 A5 覆盖）。\n53\t\n54\t### A2 冻结检查（真实仓库）\n55\t\n56\t```powershell\n57\t$out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n58\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n59\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-frozen-files exited $code\" }\n60\t$m = [regex]::Match($out, '(?m)^check-frozen-files: ok \\((\\d+) files\\)\\s*$')\n61\tif (-not $m.Success) { throw 'stdout does not match check-frozen-files: ok (<N> files)' }\n62\tif ([int]$m.Groups[1].Value -lt 8) { throw \"registered file count $($m.Groups[1].Value) is below 8\" }\n63\t'A2 OK'\n64\texit 0\n65\t```\n66\t\n67\t- 退出码 0。\n68\t- stdout 匹配 `^check-frozen-files: ok \\(\\d+ files\\)$`，且其中数字 ≥ 8（副本 7 个 + stable.test.mjs）。\n69\t\n70\t### A3 缺陷检查（真实仓库，严格模式，含 canary）\n71\t\n72\t```powershell\n73\t$out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n74\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n75\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-defects exited $code\" }\n76\tif (-not $out.Contains('check-defects: ok')) { throw 'stdout is missing check-defects: ok' }\n77\tif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n78\tif ($out.Contains('absent')) { throw 'stdout contains absent' }\n79\t'A3 OK'\n80\texit 0\n81\t```\n82\t\n83\t- 退出码 0。\n84\t- stdout 恰含 `check-defects: ok`，不含 `FAIL`、不含 `absent`。\n85\t\n86\t### A4 check-fast 执行了这两项检查\n87\t\n88\t```powershell\n89\t$out = (node scripts/check-fast.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n90\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n91\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-fast exited $code\" }\n92\tforeach ($needle in @('==> check-defects.mjs', '==> check-frozen-files.mjs', '==> npm test')) {\n93\t  if (-not $out.Contains($needle)) { throw \"missing step marker: $needle\" }\n94\t}\n95\t$lines = $out.TrimEnd() -split \"\\r?\\n\"\n96\tif ($lines[-1] -ne 'check-fast: ok') { throw \"last line is '$($lines[-1])'\" }\n97\t'A4 OK'\n98\texit 0\n99\t```\n100\t\n101\t- 退出码 0。\n102\t- stdout 含 `==> check-defects.mjs`、`==> check-frozen-files.mjs`、`==> npm test`，最后一行 `check-fast: ok`。\n103\t\n104\t### A5 完整测试\n105\t\n106\t```powershell\n107\t$out = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n108\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n109\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"run-tests exited $code\" }\n110\tif ($out -notmatch 'run-tests: full ') { throw 'stdout is missing run-tests: full' }\n111\tif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n112\t$cross = [string][char]0x2716\n113\tif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'stdout contains the failure mark' }\n114\tif (-not $out.Contains('[repro] 0.1 has no test script')) { throw 'missing the a3-runner repro title' }\n115\t$repros = [regex]::Matches($out, '\\[repro\\] \\[AC-005\\]').Count\n116\tif ($repros -lt 10) { throw \"expected 10 repro titles, found $repros\" }\n117\t'A5 OK'\n118\texit 0\n119\t```\n120\t\n121\t- 退出码 0；stdout 含 `run-tests: full `，不含 `FAIL`、`✖`。\n122\t- stdout 含 `[repro] 0.1 has no test script`（a3-runner）以及另外 10 个以 `[repro] [AC-005]` 开头的标题。\n123\t\n124\t## 2. 副本逐字节与冻结清单\n125\t\n126\t### B1 副本与 f75bb76 的 blob 一致，且文件集合恰好是 7 个\n127\t\n128\t```powershell\n129\t$out = (node -e \"const cp=require('child_process'),fs=require('fs'),c=require('crypto');const norm=b=>c.createHash('sha256').update(b.toString('latin1').replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n'),'latin1').digest('hex');const want=cp.execFileSync('git',['ls-tree','-r','--name-only','f75bb76','--','lib','config/cliworker.example.json']).toString().split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).sort();const dir='test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/';const have=[];(function w(d){for(const e of fs.readdirSync(d,{withFileTypes:true})){const p=d+'/'+e.name;e.isDirectory()?w(p):have.push(p.slice(dir.length))}})(dir.slice(0,-1));have.sort();let bad=JSON.stringify(want)!==JSON.stringify(have)?1:0;if(bad)console.log('SET',want,have);for(const p of want){const g=norm(cp.execFileSync('git',['cat-file','blob','f75bb76:'+p]));const f=norm(fs.readFileSync(dir+p));if(g!==f){bad++;console.log('DIFF',p)}}console.log(bad?'FAIL':'ok '+want.length);process.exit(bad?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n130\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n131\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"byte comparison exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n132\tif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 7') { throw \"expected 'ok 7', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n133\t'B1 OK'\n134\texit 0\n135\t```\n136\t\n137\t- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 7`（内部用 `git cat-file blob` 取原始字节，不经 PowerShell 管道）。\n138\t\n139\t### B2 frozen-files.json 的形状与允许集合\n140\t\n141\t```powershell\n142\t$out = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/characterization/frozen-files.json');const p=j.files.map(f=>f.path);const allowed=x=>x.startsWith('test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/')||x==='test/characterization/stable.test.mjs'||x.startsWith('contracts/spec/')||x.startsWith('contracts/golden/');const ok=Object.keys(j).sort().join()==='files,source_commit'&&j.source_commit==='f75bb76'&&p.every(allowed)&&!p.some(x=>/^(lib|bin|config|scripts)\\//i.test(x))&&p.includes('test/characterization/stable.test.mjs')&&p.filter(x=>x.startsWith('test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/')).length===7&&new Set(p).size===p.length&&j.files.every(f=>Object.keys(f).sort().join()==='path,sha256'&&/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/.test(f.sha256));console.log(ok?'ok '+p.length:'FAIL');process.exit(ok?0:1)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n143\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n144\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"frozen-files.json shape check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n145\tif ($out.Trim() -notmatch '^ok \\d+$') { throw \"unexpected output: '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n146\t'B2 OK'\n147\texit 0\n148\t```\n149\t\n150\t- 退出码 0，stdout 匹配 `^ok \\d+$`。\n151\t- 键恰为 `files`、`source_commit`；`source_commit` 为 `f75bb76`；每条只有 `path`、`sha256`；路径去重且全部落在允许集合内；副本 7 个且 `stable.test.mjs` 已登记。\n152\t\n153\t### B3 篡改一个登记文件的字节 → 检查失败\n154\t\n155\t```powershell\n156\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n157\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n158\ttry {\n159\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n160\t  Add-Content -Path (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs') -Value '// tamper' -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n161\t  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n162\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n163\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n164\t  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs')) { throw 'missing frozen.hash_mismatch line' }\n165\t  if (-not $out.Contains('check-frozen-files: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw 'missing FAILED summary' }\n166\t} finally {\n167\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n168\t}\n169\t'B3 OK'\n170\texit 0\n171\t```\n172\t\n173\t- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n174\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs` 和 `check-frozen-files: FAILED (1 errors)`。\n175\t\n176\t### B4 登记 lib/、bin/、config/、scripts/ 路径 → 检查失败\n177\t\n178\t```powershell\n179\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n180\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n181\ttry {\n182\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n183\t  node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const f=process.argv[1]+'/test/characterization/frozen-files.json';const j=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8'));const h='0'.repeat(64);for(const p of ['lib/select.mjs','bin/cliworker.mjs','config/cliworker.example.json','scripts/run-tests.mjs'])j.files.push({path:p,sha256:h});fs.writeFileSync(f,JSON.stringify(j,null,2))\" $t\n184\t  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n185\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n186\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n187\t  foreach ($line in @(\n188\t    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path lib/select.mjs',\n189\t    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path bin/cliworker.mjs',\n190\t    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path config/cliworker.example.json',\n191\t    'FAIL frozen.outside_allowed scripts/run-tests.mjs'\n192\t  )) { if (-not $out.Contains($line)) { throw \"missing line: $line\" } }\n193\t  if (-not $out.Contains('check-frozen-files: FAILED (4 errors)')) { throw 'missing FAILED summary' }\n194\t} finally {\n195\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n196\t}\n197\t'B4 OK'\n198\texit 0\n199\t```\n200\t\n201\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含四条 `FAIL` 行（顺序不限：`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/` 为 `frozen.forbidden_path`，`scripts/` 为 `frozen.outside_allowed`）。\n202\t- stdout 含 `check-frozen-files: FAILED (4 errors)`。\n203\t\n204\t### B5 副本里多出一个未登记文件 → 检查失败\n205\t\n206\t```powershell\n207\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n208\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n209\ttry {\n210\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n211\t  Set-Content -Path (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md') -Value 'x' -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n212\t  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n213\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n214\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n215\t  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md')) { throw 'missing frozen.unregistered line' }\n216\t} finally {\n217\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n218\t}\n219\t'B5 OK'\n220\texit 0\n221\t```\n222\t\n223\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md`。\n224\t\n225\t### B6 未知参数\n226\t\n227\t```powershell\n228\t$out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --bogus 2>&1 | Out-String)\n229\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n230\tif ($code -ne 2) { throw \"expected exit code 2, got $code\" }\n231\t'B6 OK'\n232\texit 0\n233\t```\n234\t\n235\t- 退出码 2，stderr 含 `unknown argument: --bogus`。\n236\t\n237\t## 3. stable.test.mjs 只依赖副本\n238\t\n239\t### C1 所有相对 import 都指向副本\n240\t\n241\t```powershell\n242\t$out = (node -e \"const s=require('fs').readFileSync('test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','utf8');const specs=[...s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22](\\.[^\\x27\\x22]*)[\\x27\\x22]/g)].map(m=>m[1]);const ok=specs.length>=2&&specs.every(x=>x.includes('fixtures/characterization/v0.1/'))&&!/[\\x27\\x22]\\.\\.\\/\\.\\.\\/(lib|bin|scripts)\\//.test(s);console.log(ok?'ok '+specs.length:'FAIL '+JSON.stringify(specs));process.exit(ok?0:1)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n243\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n244\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"import check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n245\tif ($out.Trim() -notmatch '^ok \\d+$') { throw \"unexpected output: '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n246\t'C1 OK'\n247\texit 0\n248\t```\n249\t\n250\t- 退出码 0，stdout 匹配 `^ok \\d+$`（相对 import 数量 ≥ 2，且每个都含 `fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`）。\n251\t\n252\t### C2 保留面是真的被锁住的：把副本里的排除原因改坏，stable 必须失败\n253\t\n254\t```powershell\n255\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-stable-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n256\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n257\ttry {\n258\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, scripts, package.json, contracts -Destination $t\n259\t  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs'\n260\t  (Get-Content -Raw $f).Replace(\"reason: 'excluded'\", \"reason: 'not_excluded'\") | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n261\t  $out = (node --test (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/stable.test.mjs') 2>&1 | Out-String)\n262\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n263\t  if ($code -eq 0) { throw 'stable.test.mjs still passed on the broken copy' }\n264\t  $cross = [string][char]0x2716\n265\t  $hit = $out.Contains('stable: exclude wins and reports excluded')\n266\t  if (-not $hit) { throw 'the exclude test did not run' }\n267\t  if (-not (($out -match 'not ok') -or $out.Contains($cross))) { throw 'no failure line reported' }\n268\t} finally {\n269\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n270\t}\n271\t'C2 OK'\n272\texit 0\n273\t```\n274\t\n275\t- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n276\t- 退出码 1；输出含 `[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded` 且带 `not ok`（或 `✖`）。\n277\t\n278\t## 4. 缺陷账本\n279\t\n280\t### D1 defects.json 恰好 11 条，字段与取值正确\n281\t\n282\t```powershell\n283\t$out = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/characterization/defects.json');const exp={'a1-quota':['T-006','M1','AC-015'],'a2-pack':['T-009','M1','AC-025'],'a3-runner':['T-001','M1','AC-001'],'a4-paths':['T-005','M1','AC-012'],'a4-null-config':['T-005','M1','AC-014'],'a5-dup-call':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-forecast-x3':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-unused':['T-007','M1','AC-022'],'a5-ignored-fields':['T-008','M1','AC-024'],'a5-shell':['T-010','M2','AC-026'],'a5-nocache':['T-022','M4','AC-055']};const d=j.defects;let bad=[];if(d.length!==11)bad.push('count '+d.length);for(const x of d){const e=exp[x.id];if(!e){bad.push('unknown '+x.id);continue}if(x.owner_task!==e[0]||x.owner_milestone!==e[1]||x.ac!==e[2])bad.push('fields '+x.id);if(!/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/.test(x.repro_sha256))bad.push('sha '+x.id)}if(new Set(d.map(x=>x.id)).size!==11)bad.push('dup');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok 11');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n284\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n285\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defects.json check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n286\tif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 11') { throw \"expected 'ok 11', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n287\t'D1 OK'\n288\texit 0\n289\t```\n290\t\n291\t- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 11`。\n292\t- 每条含 `id`、`owner_task`、`owner_milestone`、`ac`、`repro_sha256`（64 位小写十六进制），id 不重复。\n293\t\n294\t### D2 每条缺陷都有 repro 文件、canary 与合法的 canary.json，且 canary 目录里没有 `*.test.mjs`\n295\t\n296\t```powershell\n297\t$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id);let bad=[];for(const id of ids){if(!fs.existsSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs'))bad.push('repro '+id);const f='test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/canary.json';if(!fs.existsSync(f)){bad.push('canary '+id);continue}const c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8'));const hasOverlay=fs.existsSync('test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/overlay');if(c.defect!==id||!(hasOverlay||(Array.isArray(c.repro_edits)&&c.repro_edits.length>0)))bad.push('shape '+id)}(function w(d){for(const e of fs.readdirSync(d,{withFileTypes:true})){const p=d+'/'+e.name;if(e.isDirectory())w(p);else if(e.name.endsWith('.test.mjs'))bad.push('testfile '+p)}})('test/characterization/canary');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n298\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n299\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defect assets check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n300\tif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n301\t'D2 OK'\n302\texit 0\n303\t```\n304\t\n305\t- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n306\t- 11 条都有 `<id>.test.mjs` 与 `canary/<id>/canary.json`；`canary.json` 的 `defect` 等于目录名，且有 overlay 目录或非空 `repro_edits`。\n307\t\n308\t### D3 [repro] 与 [fixed] 分离\n309\t\n310\t```powershell\n311\t$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id).filter(x=>x!=='a3-runner');let bad=[];for(const id of ids){const s=fs.readFileSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs','utf8').replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n');const opens=s.split('\\n').filter(l=>/^test\\([\\x27\\x22]\\[repro\\]/.test(l));if(opens.length<1)bad.push('norepro '+id);if(opens.some(l=>!/\\{\\s*$/.test(l)))bad.push('open '+id);if(/\\[fixed\\]/.test(s))bad.push('fixed '+id);if(!/^\\}\\)$/m.test(s))bad.push('close '+id);if(!s.includes('CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT'))bad.push('root '+id)}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok '+ids.length);process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n312\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n313\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"repro section check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n314\tif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 10') { throw \"expected 'ok 10', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n315\t'D3 OK'\n316\texit 0\n317\t```\n318\t\n319\t- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 10`。\n320\t- 本任务写的 10 个文件每个都有 `[repro]` 块、没有 `[fixed]` 块；块以 `{` 结尾、以行首 `})` 结束；块外定义了 `CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT`。\n321\t\n322\t### D4 篡改 [repro] 段 → check-defects 失败\n323\t\n324\t```powershell\n325\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n326\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n327\ttry {\n328\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n329\t  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs'\n330\t  (Get-Content -Raw $f) -replace '\\[repro\\]', '[repro] edited' | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n331\t  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n332\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n333\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n334\t  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.repro_changed line' }\n335\t} finally {\n336\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n337\t}\n338\t'D4 OK'\n339\texit 0\n340\t```\n341\t\n342\t- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n343\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call`。\n344\t\n345\t### D5 canary 失效 → check-defects 失败\n346\t\n347\t```powershell\n348\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n349\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n350\ttry {\n351\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n352\t  Copy-Item -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs') (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a5-dup-call/overlay/lib/select.mjs')\n353\t  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n354\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n355\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n356\t  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_survived line' }\n357\t  $ids = @('a1-quota','a2-pack','a3-runner','a4-paths','a4-null-config','a5-forecast-x3','a5-unused','a5-ignored-fields','a5-shell','a5-nocache')\n358\t  foreach ($id in $ids) { if ($out.Contains(\"defects.canary_survived $id\")) { throw \"unexpected canary_survived for $id\" } }\n359\t} finally {\n360\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n361\t}\n362\t'D5 OK'\n363\texit 0\n364\t```\n365\t\n366\t- 把 `a5-dup-call` 的 overlay 换回未修复的 0.1 原文。\n367\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call`；不含对其它 10 个缺陷的 `canary_survived`。\n368\t\n369\t### D6 缺少 canary → check-defects 失败\n370\t\n371\t```powershell\n372\t$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n373\tNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n374\ttry {\n375\t  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n376\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a4-paths')\n377\t  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n378\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n379\t  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n380\t  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_missing line' }\n381\t} finally {\n382\t  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n383\t}\n384\t'D6 OK'\n385\texit 0\n386\t```\n387\t\n388\t- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths`。\n389\t\n390\t### D7 T-001 既有行为不变\n391\t\n392\t```powershell\n393\t$out = (node --test test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n394\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n395\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"milestone-gate test exited $code\" }\n396\t$cross = [string][char]0x2716\n397\tif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'output contains the failure mark' }\n398\tif ($out -match '(?m)^not ok ') { throw 'output contains a failing subtest' }\n399\t'D7 OK'\n400\texit 0\n401\t```\n402\t\n403\t- 退出码 0；不含 `✖`、不含 `not ok`。\n404\t\n405\t## 5. 追踪与范围\n406\t\n407\t### E1 追踪分片\n408\t\n409\t```powershell\n410\t$out = (node scripts/check-traceability.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n411\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n412\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-traceability exited $code\" }\n413\tif ($out -notmatch '(?m)^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)\\s*$') { throw 'unexpected check-traceability output' }\n414\t$json = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/traceability/T-002.json');const e=j.entries;const ok=Object.keys(j).sort().join()==='entries,milestone,task'&&j.task==='T-002'&&j.milestone==='M1'&&e.length===1&&e[0].ac==='AC-005'&&e[0].status==='covered'&&e[0].files.join()==='test/characterization/stable.test.mjs,test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs';console.log(ok?'ok':'FAIL')\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n415\tif ($json.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"T-002.json check failed: $($json.Trim())\" }\n416\t'E1 OK'\n417\texit 0\n418\t```\n419\t\n420\t- 退出码 0；stdout 匹配 `^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)$`。\n421\t- `test/traceability/T-002.json` 的键恰为 `task`、`milestone`、`entries`，且内容为 AC-005 covered、两个测试文件。\n422\t\n423\t### E2 只写了 write_scope 内的文件\n424\t\n425\t```powershell\n426\t$diff = (git diff --name-only main...HEAD | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/(tasks\\/002\\/|blueprint\\/cliworker-v2\\/task-graph\\.json$)/];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'out-of-scope: none');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n427\tif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"diff scope check failed: $($diff.Trim())\" }\n428\tif ($diff.Trim() -ne 'out-of-scope: none') { throw \"unexpected diff scope: $($diff.Trim())\" }\n429\t$status = (git status --porcelain | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/tasks\\/002\\//];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).map(l=>l.slice(3).replace(/^.* -> /,'').replace(/^\\\"|\\\"$/g,'')).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'dirty: in-scope only');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n430\tif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"working tree scope check failed: $($status.Trim())\" }\n431\tif ($status.Trim() -ne 'dirty: in-scope only') { throw \"unexpected working tree: $($status.Trim())\" }\n432\t'E2 OK'\n433\texit 0\n434\t```\n435\t\n436\t- `git diff --name-only main...HEAD` 里每条路径都落在 write_scope（含 task-graph 为本任务追加的 `scripts/check-ci.mjs`、`test/unit/traceability.test.mjs` 两处单行修复）或 `.collab/tasks/002/`、`.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`。\n437\t- `git status --porcelain` 的输出同样只落在上述范围（不含 `test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs`、`scripts/run-tests.mjs`、`package.json`、`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/`）。\n438\t\n439\t### E3 无第三方依赖、无令牌\n440\t\n441\t```powershell\n442\t$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const files=['scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs','scripts/check-defects.mjs','test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs'];const bad=[];for(const f of files){const s=fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8');for(const m of s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*|require\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22]([^\\x27\\x22]+)[\\x27\\x22]/g)){const x=m[1];if(!(x.startsWith('.')||x.startsWith('node:')))bad.push(f+' '+x)}if(/(sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}|ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|api[_-]?key\\s*[:=]\\s*[\\x27\\x22][^\\x27\\x22]{8,})/i.test(s))bad.push(f+' secret')}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n443\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n444\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"dependency check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n445\tif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n446\t'E3 OK'\n447\texit 0\n448\t```\n449\t\n450\t- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n451\t- 四个文件的 import 说明符只有相对路径与 `node:` 内置模块；没有 `sk-`/`ghp_`/`api_key` 形态的令牌。\n452\t\n453\t## 6. 各缺陷 repro 的实质内容\n454\t\n455\t### F1 每条 repro 在副本上通过\n456\t\n457\t```powershell\n458\t$files = @(\n459\t  'test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs',\n460\t  'test/characterization/defects/a2-pack.test.mjs',\n461\t  'test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs',\n462\t  'test/characterization/defects/a4-paths.test.mjs',\n463\t  'test/characterization/defects/a4-null-config.test.mjs',\n464\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs',\n465\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-forecast-x3.test.mjs',\n466\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-unused.test.mjs',\n467\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-shell.test.mjs',\n468\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-nocache.test.mjs',\n469\t  'test/characterization/defects/a5-ignored-fields.test.mjs'\n470\t)\n471\tforeach ($f in $files) {\n472\t  $out = (node --test --test-name-pattern=\"\\[repro\\]\" $f 2>&1 | Out-String)\n473\t  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n474\t  if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"$f exited $code\" }\n475\t  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# fail 0\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report fail 0\" }\n476\t  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# pass [1-9]\\d*\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report a passing subtest\" }\n477\t}\n478\t'F1 OK'\n479\texit 0\n480\t```\n481\t\n482\t- 11 个文件逐个运行，每条退出码 0，输出中 `fail 0` 且 `pass` ≥ 1。\n483\t\n484\t### F2 canary 对每个缺陷都真的命中\n485\t\n486\t```powershell\n487\t$out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n488\t$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n489\tif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-defects exited $code\" }\n490\tforeach ($failure in @('defects.canary_survived', 'defects.canary_missing', 'defects.canary_error', 'defects.repro_baseline_failed', 'defects.repro_changed')) {\n491\t  if ($out.Contains($failure)) { throw \"stdout contains $failure\" }\n492\t}\n493\tif (-not $out.Contains('check-defects: ok')) { throw 'stdout is missing check-defects: ok' }\n494\t'F2 OK'\n495\texit 0\n496\t```\n497\t\n498\t- 与 A3 同一条命令；11 个缺陷全部通过才输出 `check-defects: ok`，且不含任何 `defects.canary_*` / `defects.repro_*` 失败行。\n499\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40affc0b-220f-40fa-8bef-3bdee3f53b73","uuid":"9d7dceb1-47f7-4c83-b43f-a16c297c70b6","timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:19:33.970Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\002\\.collab\\tasks\\002\\acceptance.md","content":"# T-002 验收标准\n\n对应 AC-005（levels: unit）。所有命令在仓库根（`C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\002`）用 `pwsh -NoProfile` 执行，Node ≥ 20。基准提交：`f75bb76`（0.1 副本的来源）。brief 没有给出既有验收报告路径。\n\n格式约定（与 `ci-runner.ps1` 的解析规则一致）：每个用例是一个 `### <编号> <标题>` 小节，编号形如 `A1`、`B3`、`D4`（字母 + 数字），小节下只有一个 ```powershell 代码块且其首行就是可执行命令；断言写成紧随其后的项目符号。每个脚本在全部断言成立时打印 `<编号> OK` 并以退出码 0 结束，否则以非 0 退出。脚本自包含，不依赖任何前置小节定义的函数或变量。\n\n## 1. 总入口\n\n### A1 过滤运行 AC-005\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-005 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"run-tests --ac AC-005 exited $code\" }\nif ($out -notmatch 'run-tests: filtered ') { throw 'stdout is missing run-tests: filtered' }\nif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n$cross = [string][char]0x2716\nif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'stdout contains the failure mark' }\n$titles = @(\n  '[AC-005] stable: deprecated models are never candidates',\n  '[AC-005] stable: unverified identity is rejected unless require_verified is false',\n  '[AC-005] stable: level filter rejects other levels',\n  '[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded',\n  '[AC-005] stable: the four schema names',\n  '[AC-005] stable: imports only the v0.1 copy',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: untouched fixture root passes',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: changing one registered byte fails with frozen.hash_mismatch',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: CRLF checkout of a registered file still passes',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: lib/, bin/ and config/ paths are rejected as frozen.forbidden_path',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: scripts/ and other unlisted paths fail with frozen.outside_allowed',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: contracts/spec and contracts/golden paths are allowed',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: unregistered file in the v0.1 copy fails with frozen.unregistered',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: missing registered file fails with frozen.file_missing',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: path traversal and absolute paths are rejected',\n  '[AC-005] defects: well-formed fixture ledger passes',\n  '[AC-005] defects: repro edited after registration fails with defects.repro_changed',\n  '[AC-005] defects: canary that still passes fails with defects.canary_survived',\n  '[AC-005] defects: missing canary fails with defects.canary_missing',\n  '[AC-005] defects: repro failing on the unmodified copy fails with defects.repro_baseline_failed',\n  '[AC-005] defects: a repro that cannot even load is not counted as a canary hit'\n)\nforeach ($title in $titles) { if (-not $out.Contains($title)) { throw \"missing title: $title\" } }\n$repros = [regex]::Matches($out, '\\[repro\\] \\[AC-005\\]').Count\nif ($repros -lt 10) { throw \"expected 10 repro titles, found $repros\" }\n'A1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0。\n- stdout 含 `run-tests: filtered `，不含 `FAIL`、不含 `✖`。\n- 上面 21 个标题子串全部出现（各对应一个 `✔`）。\n- stdout 含 10 个以 `[repro] [AC-005]` 开头的标题（a3-runner 的 `[repro]` 不带 `[AC-005]` 标签，由 A5 覆盖）。\n\n### A2 冻结检查（真实仓库）\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-frozen-files exited $code\" }\n$m = [regex]::Match($out, '(?m)^check-frozen-files: ok \\((\\d+) files\\)\\s*$')\nif (-not $m.Success) { throw 'stdout does not match check-frozen-files: ok (<N> files)' }\nif ([int]$m.Groups[1].Value -lt 8) { throw \"registered file count $($m.Groups[1].Value) is below 8\" }\n'A2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0。\n- stdout 匹配 `^check-frozen-files: ok \\(\\d+ files\\)$`，且其中数字 ≥ 8（副本 7 个 + stable.test.mjs）。\n\n### A3 缺陷检查（真实仓库，严格模式，含 canary）\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-defects exited $code\" }\nif (-not $out.Contains('check-defects: ok')) { throw 'stdout is missing check-defects: ok' }\nif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\nif ($out.Contains('absent')) { throw 'stdout contains absent' }\n'A3 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0。\n- stdout 恰含 `check-defects: ok`，不含 `FAIL`、不含 `absent`。\n\n### A4 check-fast 执行了这两项检查\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-fast.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-fast exited $code\" }\nforeach ($needle in @('==> check-defects.mjs', '==> check-frozen-files.mjs', '==> npm test')) {\n  if (-not $out.Contains($needle)) { throw \"missing step marker: $needle\" }\n}\n$lines = $out.TrimEnd() -split \"\\r?\\n\"\nif ($lines[-1] -ne 'check-fast: ok') { throw \"last line is '$($lines[-1])'\" }\n'A4 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0。\n- stdout 含 `==> check-defects.mjs`、`==> check-frozen-files.mjs`、`==> npm test`，最后一行 `check-fast: ok`。\n\n### A5 完整测试\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"run-tests exited $code\" }\nif ($out -notmatch 'run-tests: full ') { throw 'stdout is missing run-tests: full' }\nif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n$cross = [string][char]0x2716\nif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'stdout contains the failure mark' }\nif (-not $out.Contains('[repro] 0.1 has no test script')) { throw 'missing the a3-runner repro title' }\n$repros = [regex]::Matches($out, '\\[repro\\] \\[AC-005\\]').Count\nif ($repros -lt 10) { throw \"expected 10 repro titles, found $repros\" }\n'A5 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0；stdout 含 `run-tests: full `，不含 `FAIL`、`✖`。\n- stdout 含 `[repro] 0.1 has no test script`（a3-runner）以及另外 10 个以 `[repro] [AC-005]` 开头的标题。\n\n## 2. 副本逐字节与冻结清单\n\n### B1 副本与 f75bb76 的 blob 一致，且文件集合恰好是 7 个\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const cp=require('child_process'),fs=require('fs'),c=require('crypto');const norm=b=>c.createHash('sha256').update(b.toString('latin1').replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n'),'latin1').digest('hex');const want=cp.execFileSync('git',['ls-tree','-r','--name-only','f75bb76','--','lib','config/cliworker.example.json']).toString().split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).sort();const dir='test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/';const have=[];(function w(d){for(const e of fs.readdirSync(d,{withFileTypes:true})){const p=d+'/'+e.name;e.isDirectory()?w(p):have.push(p.slice(dir.length))}})(dir.slice(0,-1));have.sort();let bad=JSON.stringify(want)!==JSON.stringify(have)?1:0;if(bad)console.log('SET',want,have);for(const p of want){const g=norm(cp.execFileSync('git',['cat-file','blob','f75bb76:'+p]));const f=norm(fs.readFileSync(dir+p));if(g!==f){bad++;console.log('DIFF',p)}}console.log(bad?'FAIL':'ok '+want.length);process.exit(bad?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"byte comparison exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 7') { throw \"expected 'ok 7', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'B1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 7`（内部用 `git cat-file blob` 取原始字节，不经 PowerShell 管道）。\n\n### B2 frozen-files.json 的形状与允许集合\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/characterization/frozen-files.json');const p=j.files.map(f=>f.path);const allowed=x=>x.startsWith('test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/')||x==='test/characterization/stable.test.mjs'||x.startsWith('contracts/spec/')||x.startsWith('contracts/golden/');const ok=Object.keys(j).sort().join()==='files,source_commit'&&j.source_commit==='f75bb76'&&p.every(allowed)&&!p.some(x=>/^(lib|bin|config|scripts)\\//i.test(x))&&p.includes('test/characterization/stable.test.mjs')&&p.filter(x=>x.startsWith('test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/')).length===7&&new Set(p).size===p.length&&j.files.every(f=>Object.keys(f).sort().join()==='path,sha256'&&/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/.test(f.sha256));console.log(ok?'ok '+p.length:'FAIL');process.exit(ok?0:1)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"frozen-files.json shape check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -notmatch '^ok \\d+$') { throw \"unexpected output: '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'B2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 匹配 `^ok \\d+$`。\n- 键恰为 `files`、`source_commit`；`source_commit` 为 `f75bb76`；每条只有 `path`、`sha256`；路径去重且全部落在允许集合内；副本 7 个且 `stable.test.mjs` 已登记。\n\n### B3 篡改一个登记文件的字节 → 检查失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  Add-Content -Path (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs') -Value '// tamper' -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs')) { throw 'missing frozen.hash_mismatch line' }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('check-frozen-files: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw 'missing FAILED summary' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'B3 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL frozen.hash_mismatch test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs` 和 `check-frozen-files: FAILED (1 errors)`。\n\n### B4 登记 lib/、bin/、config/、scripts/ 路径 → 检查失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const f=process.argv[1]+'/test/characterization/frozen-files.json';const j=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8'));const h='0'.repeat(64);for(const p of ['lib/select.mjs','bin/cliworker.mjs','config/cliworker.example.json','scripts/run-tests.mjs'])j.files.push({path:p,sha256:h});fs.writeFileSync(f,JSON.stringify(j,null,2))\" $t\n  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  foreach ($line in @(\n    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path lib/select.mjs',\n    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path bin/cliworker.mjs',\n    'FAIL frozen.forbidden_path config/cliworker.example.json',\n    'FAIL frozen.outside_allowed scripts/run-tests.mjs'\n  )) { if (-not $out.Contains($line)) { throw \"missing line: $line\" } }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('check-frozen-files: FAILED (4 errors)')) { throw 'missing FAILED summary' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'B4 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含四条 `FAIL` 行（顺序不限：`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/` 为 `frozen.forbidden_path`，`scripts/` 为 `frozen.outside_allowed`）。\n- stdout 含 `check-frozen-files: FAILED (4 errors)`。\n\n### B5 副本里多出一个未登记文件 → 检查失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-frozen-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  Set-Content -Path (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md') -Value 'x' -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md')) { throw 'missing frozen.unregistered line' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'B5 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md`。\n\n### B6 未知参数\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --bogus 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 2) { throw \"expected exit code 2, got $code\" }\n'B6 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 2，stderr 含 `unknown argument: --bogus`。\n\n## 3. stable.test.mjs 只依赖副本\n\n### C1 所有相对 import 都指向副本\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const s=require('fs').readFileSync('test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','utf8');const specs=[...s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22](\\.[^\\x27\\x22]*)[\\x27\\x22]/g)].map(m=>m[1]);const ok=specs.length>=2&&specs.every(x=>x.includes('fixtures/characterization/v0.1/'))&&!/[\\x27\\x22]\\.\\.\\/\\.\\.\\/(lib|bin|scripts)\\//.test(s);console.log(ok?'ok '+specs.length:'FAIL '+JSON.stringify(specs));process.exit(ok?0:1)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"import check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -notmatch '^ok \\d+$') { throw \"unexpected output: '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'C1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 匹配 `^ok \\d+$`（相对 import 数量 ≥ 2，且每个都含 `fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`）。\n\n### C2 保留面是真的被锁住的：把副本里的排除原因改坏，stable 必须失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-stable-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, scripts, package.json, contracts -Destination $t\n  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs'\n  (Get-Content -Raw $f).Replace(\"reason: 'excluded'\", \"reason: 'not_excluded'\") | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n  $out = (node --test (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/stable.test.mjs') 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -eq 0) { throw 'stable.test.mjs still passed on the broken copy' }\n  $cross = [string][char]0x2716\n  $hit = $out.Contains('stable: exclude wins and reports excluded')\n  if (-not $hit) { throw 'the exclude test did not run' }\n  if (-not (($out -match 'not ok') -or $out.Contains($cross))) { throw 'no failure line reported' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'C2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n- 退出码 1；输出含 `[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded` 且带 `not ok`（或 `✖`）。\n\n## 4. 缺陷账本\n\n### D1 defects.json 恰好 11 条，字段与取值正确\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/characterization/defects.json');const exp={'a1-quota':['T-006','M1','AC-015'],'a2-pack':['T-009','M1','AC-025'],'a3-runner':['T-001','M1','AC-001'],'a4-paths':['T-005','M1','AC-012'],'a4-null-config':['T-005','M1','AC-014'],'a5-dup-call':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-forecast-x3':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-unused':['T-007','M1','AC-022'],'a5-ignored-fields':['T-008','M1','AC-024'],'a5-shell':['T-010','M2','AC-026'],'a5-nocache':['T-022','M4','AC-055']};const d=j.defects;let bad=[];if(d.length!==11)bad.push('count '+d.length);for(const x of d){const e=exp[x.id];if(!e){bad.push('unknown '+x.id);continue}if(x.owner_task!==e[0]||x.owner_milestone!==e[1]||x.ac!==e[2])bad.push('fields '+x.id);if(!/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/.test(x.repro_sha256))bad.push('sha '+x.id)}if(new Set(d.map(x=>x.id)).size!==11)bad.push('dup');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok 11');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defects.json check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 11') { throw \"expected 'ok 11', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'D1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 11`。\n- 每条含 `id`、`owner_task`、`owner_milestone`、`ac`、`repro_sha256`（64 位小写十六进制），id 不重复。\n\n### D2 每条缺陷都有 repro 文件、canary 与合法的 canary.json，且 canary 目录里没有 `*.test.mjs`\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id);let bad=[];for(const id of ids){if(!fs.existsSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs'))bad.push('repro '+id);const f='test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/canary.json';if(!fs.existsSync(f)){bad.push('canary '+id);continue}const c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8'));const hasOverlay=fs.existsSync('test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/overlay');if(c.defect!==id||!(hasOverlay||(Array.isArray(c.repro_edits)&&c.repro_edits.length>0)))bad.push('shape '+id)}(function w(d){for(const e of fs.readdirSync(d,{withFileTypes:true})){const p=d+'/'+e.name;if(e.isDirectory())w(p);else if(e.name.endsWith('.test.mjs'))bad.push('testfile '+p)}})('test/characterization/canary');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defect assets check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'D2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n- 11 条都有 `<id>.test.mjs` 与 `canary/<id>/canary.json`；`canary.json` 的 `defect` 等于目录名，且有 overlay 目录或非空 `repro_edits`。\n\n### D3 [repro] 与 [fixed] 分离\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id).filter(x=>x!=='a3-runner');let bad=[];for(const id of ids){const s=fs.readFileSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs','utf8').replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n');const opens=s.split('\\n').filter(l=>/^test\\([\\x27\\x22]\\[repro\\]/.test(l));if(opens.length<1)bad.push('norepro '+id);if(opens.some(l=>!/\\{\\s*$/.test(l)))bad.push('open '+id);if(/\\[fixed\\]/.test(s))bad.push('fixed '+id);if(!/^\\}\\)$/m.test(s))bad.push('close '+id);if(!s.includes('CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT'))bad.push('root '+id)}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok '+ids.length);process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"repro section check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 10') { throw \"expected 'ok 10', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'D3 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 10`。\n- 本任务写的 10 个文件每个都有 `[repro]` 块、没有 `[fixed]` 块；块以 `{` 结尾、以行首 `})` 结束；块外定义了 `CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT`。\n\n### D4 篡改 [repro] 段 → check-defects 失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs'\n  (Get-Content -Raw $f) -replace '\\[repro\\]', '[repro] edited' | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.repro_changed line' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'D4 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call`。\n\n### D5 canary 失效 → check-defects 失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  Copy-Item -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs') (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a5-dup-call/overlay/lib/select.mjs')\n  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_survived line' }\n  $ids = @('a1-quota','a2-pack','a3-runner','a4-paths','a4-null-config','a5-forecast-x3','a5-unused','a5-ignored-fields','a5-shell','a5-nocache')\n  foreach ($id in $ids) { if ($out.Contains(\"defects.canary_survived $id\")) { throw \"unexpected canary_survived for $id\" } }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'D5 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 把 `a5-dup-call` 的 overlay 换回未修复的 0.1 原文。\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call`；不含对其它 10 个缺陷的 `canary_survived`。\n\n### D6 缺少 canary → check-defects 失败\n\n```powershell\n$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\nNew-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\ntry {\n  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a4-paths')\n  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_missing line' }\n} finally {\n  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n}\n'D6 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths`。\n\n### D7 T-001 既有行为不变\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node --test test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"milestone-gate test exited $code\" }\n$cross = [string][char]0x2716\nif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'output contains the failure mark' }\nif ($out -match '(?m)^not ok ') { throw 'output contains a failing subtest' }\n'D7 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0；不含 `✖`、不含 `not ok`。\n\n## 5. 追踪与范围\n\n### E1 追踪分片\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-traceability.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-traceability exited $code\" }\nif ($out -notmatch '(?m)^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)\\s*$') { throw 'unexpected check-traceability output' }\n$json = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/traceability/T-002.json');const e=j.entries;const ok=Object.keys(j).sort().join()==='entries,milestone,task'&&j.task==='T-002'&&j.milestone==='M1'&&e.length===1&&e[0].ac==='AC-005'&&e[0].status==='covered'&&e[0].files.join()==='test/characterization/stable.test.mjs,test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs';console.log(ok?'ok':'FAIL')\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\nif ($json.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"T-002.json check failed: $($json.Trim())\" }\n'E1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0；stdout 匹配 `^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)$`。\n- `test/traceability/T-002.json` 的键恰为 `task`、`milestone`、`entries`，且内容为 AC-005 covered、两个测试文件。\n\n### E2 只写了 write_scope 内的文件\n\n```powershell\n$diff = (git diff --name-only main...HEAD | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/(tasks\\/002\\/|blueprint\\/cliworker-v2\\/task-graph\\.json$)/];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'out-of-scope: none');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"diff scope check failed: $($diff.Trim())\" }\nif ($diff.Trim() -ne 'out-of-scope: none') { throw \"unexpected diff scope: $($diff.Trim())\" }\n$status = (git status --porcelain | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/tasks\\/002\\//];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).map(l=>l.slice(3).replace(/^.* -> /,'').replace(/^\\\"|\\\"$/g,'')).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'dirty: in-scope only');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"working tree scope check failed: $($status.Trim())\" }\nif ($status.Trim() -ne 'dirty: in-scope only') { throw \"unexpected working tree: $($status.Trim())\" }\n'E2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- `git diff --name-only main...HEAD` 里每条路径都落在 write_scope（含 task-graph 为本任务追加的 `scripts/check-ci.mjs`、`test/unit/traceability.test.mjs` 两处单行修复）或 `.collab/tasks/002/`、`.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`。\n- `git status --porcelain` 的输出同样只落在上述范围（不含 `test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs`、`scripts/run-tests.mjs`、`package.json`、`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/`）。\n\n### E3 无第三方依赖、无令牌\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const files=['scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs','scripts/check-defects.mjs','test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs'];const bad=[];for(const f of files){const s=fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8');for(const m of s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*|require\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22]([^\\x27\\x22]+)[\\x27\\x22]/g)){const x=m[1];if(!(x.startsWith('.')||x.startsWith('node:')))bad.push(f+' '+x)}if(/(sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}|ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|api[_-]?key\\s*[:=]\\s*[\\x27\\x22][^\\x27\\x22]{8,})/i.test(s))bad.push(f+' secret')}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"dependency check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\nif ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n'E3 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n- 四个文件的 import 说明符只有相对路径与 `node:` 内置模块；没有 `sk-`/`ghp_`/`api_key` 形态的令牌。\n\n## 6. 各缺陷 repro 的实质内容\n\n### F1 每条 repro 在副本上通过\n\n```powershell\n$files = @(\n  'test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a2-pack.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a4-paths.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a4-null-config.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-forecast-x3.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-unused.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-shell.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-nocache.test.mjs',\n  'test/characterization/defects/a5-ignored-fields.test.mjs'\n)\nforeach ($f in $files) {\n  $out = (node --test --test-name-pattern=\"\\[repro\\]\" $f 2>&1 | Out-String)\n  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n  if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"$f exited $code\" }\n  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# fail 0\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report fail 0\" }\n  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# pass [1-9]\\d*\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report a passing subtest\" }\n}\n'F1 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 11 个文件逐个运行，每条退出码 0，输出中 `fail 0` 且 `pass` ≥ 1。\n\n### F2 canary 对每个缺陷都真的命中\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-defects exited $code\" }\nforeach ($failure in @('defects.canary_survived', 'defects.canary_missing', 'defects.canary_error', 'defects.repro_baseline_failed', 'defects.repro_changed')) {\n  if ($out.Contains($failure)) { throw \"stdout contains $failure\" }\n}\nif (-not $out.Contains('check-defects: ok')) { throw 'stdout is missing check-defects: ok' }\n'F2 OK'\nexit 0\n```\n\n- 与 A3 同一条命令；11 个缺陷全部通过才输出 `check-defects: ok`，且不含任何 `defects.canary_*` / `defects.repro_*` 失败行。\n","numLines":499,"startLine":1,"totalLines":499}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W1kZDSwu7cCcZBAWjutFPf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
